    "intro_narrative": "You wake up in the dimly lit office of a disgraced private investigator who vanished weeks ago. Rain lashes against the frosted glass window, casting distorted shadows across a chaotic array of retro-tech machines and locked archives. The investigator was on the verge of uncovering a city-wide conspiracy, and now the culprits are coming for you. Your only way out is to piece together the evidence left behind, navigate the interconnected systems, and send out the final compressed distress signal before they breach the door. Time is running out.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
